                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Only light chariots may be used in an early army; only heavy chariots may be used in a later army. Light Chariots have a driver and one crewman armed with hand weapon, thrusting spear, light armour and shield. Light Chariot crewman may have a bow (+8 points). Light Chariots. Expert Horsemen. Cause Fear.</characteristic>
