              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Only light chariots may be used in an early army; only heavy chariots may be used in a later army. Heavy chariots have a driver and two crewman armed with hand weapon, thrusting spear, light armour and shield. One crewman has bow. Heavy Chariots. Expert Horsemen. Cause Fear. Heavy Chariot may add another crewman to gain an extra attack (+7 points) with javelins instead of thrusting spear. Note this may not be done for characters’ chariots Chariot Runners have Hand weapon, javelins and shield. Light Infantry; Chariot Runners. May not be more units of chariot runners than there are of chariots. Early army only.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
